    "taskTitle": "Design cost-optimized network architectures",
    "inShort": "Cheapest networking = keep traffic private and local: same-AZ private-IP traffic is free, gateway endpoints for S3/DynamoDB are free, and the right connection type depends on how many VPCs you have and how much data you move.",
